      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION 
        "These are the informations which are inserted in the logbook of DVB receiver.
        
        There are three sections:
          1..39  : states
         40..79  : warnings
         80..120 : faults
        
        Items named messageXX are currently not used.
        
        Note: RfOn(4) is obsolete!"
